Ingredients
Main Ingredients
Okok leaves: 500 g, shredded into paper-thin, silk-like threads (usually sold pre-cut in markets).

Palm nut juice (Jus de noix de palme / Sauce graine): 1 liter (freshly extracted or canned concentration).   
Madiba Shop

Dark roasted peanut paste: 300–400 g (made from heavily roasted skinless peanuts ground into a smooth paste).

Water: 1 to 2 cups (as needed for consistency).

Seasoning
Sugar: 3–5 tbsp (adjust gradually to taste).   
