Instructions
Step 1: Prepare the Okok Leaves
Rinse the shredded Okok leaves thoroughly in cold water to remove any dirt or residue.   
Lumo

Drain and squeeze out excess water, then set aside. (If the leaves are particularly tough, you can boil or steam them briefly to soften them before adding).   
Madiba Shop

Step 2: Simmer the Palm Cream Base
Pour the palm nut juice into a medium or large pot.   
Madiba Shop

Bring to a gentle boil over medium heat for about 8–10 minutes, stirring occasionally.

Step 3: Incorporate the Roasted Peanut Paste
Add the dark roasted peanut paste directly into the boiling palm nut juice.   
Lumo

Stir thoroughly using a wooden spoon until the peanut paste melts smoothly into the palm cream without lumps.   
