Step 4: Add the Okok Leaves & Seasoning
Add the pinch of salt and gradually stir in the sugar (start with 2–3 tablespoons, taste, and add more if desired).   
Lumo

Add the washed Okok leaves into the pot in batches, stirring well to combine with the thick sauce.   
Lumo

Lower the heat as much as possible and let the stew simmer gently for another 10–15 minutes.   
